# DEPRECATED: Legacy SDL / Unix Driver

## Status
This directory contains the legacy SDL-based Linux/Unix driver and the `unix-netplay` module.

As of Phase 6 of the FCEUX11 Construction Plan, this entire directory tree is **deprecated** and **no longer participates in the build**.

## Rationale
- FCEUX11 targets Windows 11 exclusively; Linux and macOS are no longer supported platforms.
- The Qt6 driver (`src/drivers/Qt/`) is the sole supported UI and platform abstraction layer.
- `unix-netplay.cpp` in `src/drivers/Qt/` remains part of the Qt6 driver build as the netplay implementation; the copy in this deprecated directory is no longer used.

## Retention Period
This directory is preserved in the repository for reference and to satisfy license history requirements under GPLv2. It may be physically removed in a future release.

## Date of Deprecation
2026-05-17
